{
  "esm": "1.3.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "forced_column",
    "description": "M2 planner fixture: data-fed parameters (spec/plan.md §4.1, §6.3). A column relaxation whose rate reads a two-record temperature field blended in time, a pointwise source scaled by a constant data-fed scalar, an initial condition read from data, and a data-fed field nothing reads. The planner never opens the data files."
